&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive - DACH&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Unframe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unframe is an AI-first startup helping the world’s largest enterprises bring LLM-powered applications to life in days - not months. We combine the speed of a product company with the flexibility of a consultancy, helping customers move from idea to deployed AI systems faster than anyone else in the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With over $100M in TCV secured within 12 months, and a $50M Series B led by Highland Europe, Unframe is rapidly scaling globally alongside Fortune 500 customers, backed by Bessemer, Craft, and TLV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team and help drive our go-to-market motion. You’ll play a pivotal role in landing our first major customers, shaping our sales playbook, and partnering directly with the Executive GM - EMEA and founder to build a high-performance revenue engine. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is an individual contributor (IC) role with the opportunity to shape and build our presence in the DACH market.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Enterprise Transformation: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles into highly regulated industries (FinServ, Healthcare, Manufacturing, Retail) where our on-premises capabilities provide a competitive advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Full Sales Cycle: &lt;/strong&gt;Build pipeline from zero in an early-stage environment, identify and win strategic enterprise accounts with no hand-raisers or established playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Translate complex AI/ML capabilities into compelling business outcomes for C-suite stakeholders, positioning Unframe for companies seeking to “buy vs. build” AI capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Expansion: &lt;/strong&gt;Architect multi-year expansion strategies and build deep relationships across IT, product, and innovation teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate directly with the Global VP of Revenue and founders to refine the enterprise strategy and influence the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years enterprise software sales with consistent quota over-achievement at Fortune 500 companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record closing $1M+ ACV deals in early-stage environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling complex technical solutions to CIO organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in AI/ML platforms, digital transformation, enterprise data platforms, or management consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset, you thrive in ambiguity, own outcomes, and build from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success in highly regulated industries with complex compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regulated industry experience, early-stage success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation is uncapped with aggressive accelerators. At $1M+ ACV deal sizes, this structure rewards over-performance on meaningful deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our VP of Sales joined Unframe for three reasons: a founder with a proven exit, tier-one investors, and a product that's genuinely different and defensible. The GTM approach backs that up. Buyers get a free POC, tailored to their actual use case, delivered in days. No data sharing, no upfront cost, no six-month consulting engagement before anyone sees value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You'll work directly with the VP of Sales and founders, shape GTM strategy, close the deals that define our market position, and hold equity in a company with real institutional backing and momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We hire with intention. If you thrive in a performance culture with real backing behind you, you will win here.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to Build the Future?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this opportunity excites you, apply now!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</p>

&lt;div class="content-intro"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allow us to introduce ourselves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hello there! We’re Appinio, a global market research company that combines an AI-powered insights platform with expert consultancy. On a mission to make the world a little more fact-based, we help companies understand how consumers think and make smarter decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started out in Hamburg back in 2014, but we’re now humbled to call the world our playground, with over &lt;strong&gt;260 employees&lt;/strong&gt; spread across &lt;strong&gt;13 countries &lt;/strong&gt;(we’re remote-first), 2600+ international clients, delivering research from &lt;strong data-stringify-type="bold"&gt;+190 markets,&lt;/strong&gt; globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to be a part of the Appinio movement? &lt;strong&gt;🚀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces="true"&gt;Here at Appinio, we value &lt;strong&gt;transparency&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;in our recruitment process&lt;/strong&gt;, and we've created a blog to share what to expect during each step of our journey together:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces="true"&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type="italic"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-preserver-spaces="true"&gt;&lt;a class="c-link c-link--focus-visible" href="https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process" target="_blank" data-stringify-link="https://www.appinio.com/en/blog/life-at-appinio/appinio-recruitment-process" data-sk="tooltip_parent"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="role"&gt;
&lt;div class="job-ad-editable job-ad-editable job-ad-editor" data-content="6454830"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission as a Working Student Customer Success DACH (m/f/d)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Working Student to support our Customer Success team in DACH. In this role, you will work closely with our Customer Success Managers, helping ensure our customers get the insights they need to succeed in their business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You'll be part of a team that is shaping the future of market research and consumer insights, while gaining valuable hands-on experience and building a strong foundation for a future career in Customer Success, Account Management, or Sales at one of Europe's fastest-growing companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-advanced-banner" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-block" data-block-id="block-N2rGjjmB_y" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support the monitoring and optimization of data flows between HubSpot and internal tools and workspaces (e.g. ClickUp and PandaDoc) to ensure smooth data synchronization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will prepare slides and other materials to support client communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop content and formats to educate and engage customers, such as newsletters, use cases, and benchmarks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will support day-to-day operational tasks, including planning and organizing monthly meetings and managing digital workspaces for team collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-advanced-banner" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-block" data-block-id="block-9-ZqlY_cv4" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will thrive in this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a &lt;strong&gt;strong analytical mindset&lt;/strong&gt; and combine data-driven problem-solving with a structured, diligent, and proactive get-things-done approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly &lt;strong&gt;proficient with Excel &lt;/strong&gt;(including formulas and pivot tables) &lt;strong&gt;and PowerPoint&lt;/strong&gt; (particularly when visualizing data and metrics)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong verbal and written communication skills in both &lt;strong&gt;German (C1)&lt;/strong&gt; and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled at a German university, with &lt;strong&gt;at least&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;12 months remaining in your studies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you have gained some &lt;strong&gt;experience in a fast-paced environment&lt;/strong&gt;, such as a startup, tech company, or consulting firm&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally, you have experience with &lt;strong&gt;SalesForce, HubSpot, Tableau&lt;/strong&gt;, or similar marketing, sales automation, or analytics tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-advanced-banner" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;
&lt;div class="ql-block" data-block-id="block-_4h0GIwWzy" data-advanced-banner="d2690026-0d22-4d1d-a78e-c7617e91876a" data-advanced-banner-color="yellow"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Urban Sports Club or ClassPass membership based on location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
