&lt;p&gt;Are you curious about the operational side of HR and ready to start your career in a global tech company? Join our Germany country team as a People Associate Working Student. You’ll get hands-on HR experience, work with friendly and ambitious colleagues, and see your work make a difference every day. Based in Berlin, reporting into Team Lead, HR Operations Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
